  text "#{value} ({t.Was}) from {who} was merged into this ticket. Their last message: “{last}”" => "#{value} ({t.Was}) från {who} slogs ihop med det här ärendet. Deras senaste meddelande: ”{last}”";
  /// DeskCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {value} = … (int), {who} = who (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "#{value} from {who} was merged into this ticket." => "#{value} från {who} slogs ihop med det här ärendet.";
  /// DeskCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
