  text "Reopened: the customer wrote back." => "Återöppnat: kunden svarade.";
  /// DeskCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {value} = … (int) — {value} is a count: give one text per plural form
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "Solved after {value} days with no word from the customer." => { one: "Löst efter en dag utan svar från kunden.", other: "Löst efter {value} dagar utan svar från kunden." };
  /// DeskCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {value} = … (int) — {value} is a count: give one text per plural form
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "Solved its {value} incidents with it." => { one: "Löste sin incident tillsammans med det.", other: "Löste sina {value} incidenter tillsammans med det." };
  /// DeskCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
