  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a button's label · at most ~34 characters
  /// shown through Button.label
  button "Start a privacy request…" => "Starta en integritetsförfrågan…";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a hint under a field
  /// shown through Field.hint
  /// beside: "What they ask for", "How you checked it is them", "Cancel"
  hint "Required — a request in somebody else's name is a known way to steal their data." => "Krävs. En förfrågan i någon annans namn är ett känt sätt att stjäla personens uppgifter.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~37 characters
  /// shown through Dropdown.label
  /// beside: "What they ask for", "In your words", "Cancel"
  label "How you checked it is them" => "Hur du kontrollerade att det är hen";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~19 characters
  /// shown through Field.label
  /// beside: "What they ask for", "How you checked it is them", "Cancel"
  label "In your words" => "Med dina ord";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~24 characters
  /// shown through Dropdown.label
  /// beside: "How you checked it is them", "In your words", "Cancel"
  label "What they ask for" => "Vad personen ber om";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · placeholder text inside an empty field · at most ~80 characters
  /// shown through Field.placeholder
  /// beside: "What they ask for", "How you checked it is them", "Cancel"
  placeholder "A code to the address they write from came back on 3 Oct." => "En kod till adressen som personen skriver från kom tillbaka den 3 okt.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Filed on their behalf. You will see what it would do before anything happens — a complaint is kept for legal claims, the rest erased — and it runs only once an admin approves it on the Inbox, within a month of today." => "Registreras för personens räkning. Du ser vad den skulle göra innan något händer: ett klagomål sparas för rättsliga anspråk, resten raderas. Den körs först när en administratör godkänner den i Inkorgen, inom en månad från i dag.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a subtitle
  /// placeholders: {value} = … (string)
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "The request is on the Inbox, due {value}. An admin approves the plan there; until then nothing is erased." => "Förfrågan finns i Inkorgen och ska vara klar {value}. En administratör godkänner planen där; till dess raderas inget.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "within a month" => "inom en månad";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · text on the page
  text "The desk holds nothing about them — the request will say so." => "Supportcentret har inget om personen, och förfrågan kommer att säga det.";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a title
  /// placeholders: {name} = name (string)
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "A privacy request for {name}" => "En integritetsförfrågan för {name}";
  /// StartPrivacyRequest · a title
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "Planned — nothing has happened yet" => "Planerad, inget har hänt än";

